@server=http://localhost:4004
@agent=/a2a/hr-agent
@leave=/odata/v4/leave

# Local runs use the `llm-mock` model — the plugin's stand-in, which returns
# canned text and never calls a tool. The A2A requests below therefore prove
# the plumbing (routing, agent card, task persistence), not the answers. The
# LeaveService requests further down exercise the actual rules and the PDF;
# test/integration covers the agent's tools end to end.
#
# Logins are the mocked users from package.json: alice, bob, carol, all with
# an empty password. The chat preview is at
# http://localhost:4004/a2a/hr-agent/preview/ (the browser asks once).


### Agent card — what an A2A client discovers the agent by
# @name agent_card
GET {{server}}{{agent}}/.well-known/agent-card.json
Authorization: Basic alice:


### Ask the agent (JSON-RPC, A2A `message/send`)
# @name message_send
POST {{server}}{{agent}}/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "1",
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "kind": "message",
      "messageId": "msg-1",
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [
        { "kind": "text", "text": "I'd like to take 3 days of annual leave starting 10 November, can you plan it?" }
      ]
    }
  }
}


### LeaveService — Alice's balance
GET {{server}}{{leave}}/getBalance()
Authorization: Basic alice:


### LeaveService — plan 3 working days from 10 November 2026 (saves nothing)
GET {{server}}{{leave}}/planLeave(startDate=2026-11-10,workingDays=3)
Authorization: Basic alice:


### LeaveService — a plan across the 29 October holiday and a weekend
GET {{server}}{{leave}}/planLeave(startDate=2026-10-28,workingDays=3)
Authorization: Basic alice:


### LeaveService — file the request and create its PDF
# @name submit
POST {{server}}{{leave}}/submitLeave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:

{ "startDate": "2026-11-10", "workingDays": 3, "reason": "Family visit" }


### LeaveService — download the PDF of the request filed above
GET {{server}}{{submit.response.body.pdfUrl}}
Authorization: Basic alice:


### LeaveService — the same PDF as another employee: 404
GET {{server}}{{submit.response.body.pdfUrl}}
Authorization: Basic bob:


### LeaveService — Alice's requests this year
GET {{server}}{{leave}}/getLeaveRequests()
Authorization: Basic alice:


### LeaveService — as the manager: requests of the team waiting for approval
# @name pending
GET {{server}}{{leave}}/getPendingApprovals()
Authorization: Basic carol:


### LeaveService — the same as an employee: 403, managers only
GET {{server}}{{leave}}/getPendingApprovals()
Authorization: Basic alice:


### LeaveService — approve the first waiting request; updates its PDF
POST {{server}}{{leave}}/decideLeave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic carol:

{ "requestId": "{{pending.response.body.value[0].ID}}", "decision": "approve" }


### LeaveService — reject needs a note: 400 without one
POST {{server}}{{leave}}/decideLeave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic carol:

{ "requestId": "{{pending.response.body.value[0].ID}}", "decision": "reject" }

